nother city?",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_103","That's what we hoped. Until their gear hit the junk markets ... still caked in blood.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","The merchant described the seller: black robes, hood pulled low to hide the face.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_100","So they were ... mugged?",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_103","I don't know... But get this. The merchant tried to peek under the hood, and he saw it.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","There was no face. Just a void. A deep, bottomless black hole.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_368"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"xiaozhen"],["say","avg3_100","",0,""],["say","avg3_100","Is this ... some kind of horror story?",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_103","Word is, those Trekkers weren't robbed. The Dusk Arbiters took them. Dragged them off to be tortured as heretics.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_103","And that faceless figure? They say it was someone beautiful, so beautiful the Arbiters flayed their face off... And now, magic forces the corpse to fence their loot.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","Now, nobody dares set foot in the Wilds.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_100","That explains why the Monolith is crawling with Stellaroids.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_103","They say the scariest Arbiter on the streets is the one with a hangman's knot around her neck.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","Anyone she catches gets stuffed into a box of spikes and has their soul ripped out! No exceptions!",0,""],["say","avg1_103","",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"chijing"],["w",0.8],["bg","flatlands_daylight",0,0.0],["show","avg1_149","a","002",null,-0.35,1.35,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","An Arbiter with a hangman's knot around her neck...",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.2,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["w",0.6],["ctl","avg1_149","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.6],["w",0.6],["mrt",2,"y","007","symbol",null],["sa